Senior Automation Engineer  - UiPath &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Roboyo&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;is a category shaper in Applied AI and Agentic Automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We help leading enterprises move from automation projects and AI experiments into governed, production-grade systems that execute real work across workflows, processes,&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
