Partner Account Manager - France &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste de direction est essentiel : il consiste à construire et à faire passer à l’échelle les partenariats d’Anthropic avec les cabinets de conseil, les intégrateurs de systèmes mondiaux (GSI) et les boutiques partenaires nativement IA en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec l’équipe commerciale pour que les clients adoptent l’IA grâce à nos partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste est un poste de construction, et non de gestion. Compte tenu du stade de développement d’Anthropic, nous recherchons un profil qui a déjà fait ses preuves en faisant passer des partenariats de zéro à des moteurs de revenus à grande échelle, un profil qui a bâti ces relations de A à Z, et non simplement hérité de relations existantes pour les gérer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partenariats et exécution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous collaborerez étroitement avec l’équipe commerciale pour comprendre comment les partenaires peuvent soutenir l’adoption de Claude par les clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous accompagnerez les partenaires dans la création de solutions clients reproductibles, répondant à des cas d’usage précis dans de nombreux secteurs : services financiers, santé, distribution, industrie, secteur public et services professionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance et pilotage des indicateurs clés (KPI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous portez la responsabilité des indicateurs clés de performance et vous les pilotez : revenus influencés par les partenaires, livraison réalisée par les partenaires, nombre de personnes consultantes formées et certifiées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chaque deal influencé par votre portefeuille de partenaires doit être conçu pour la réussite du client et la croissance de sa valeur à long terme. Vous définirez des critères de réussite pour les comptes communs, veillerez à la qualité de la mise en œuvre et de l’accompagnement à l’adoption, et mettrez en place des boucles de retour d’expérience favorisant l’amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous rendrez compte de la santé des partenariats, de leur avancement et de leurs résultats commerciaux, en vous appuyant sur des analyses fondées sur les données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement du marché et construction de la marque&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous renforcerez la notoriété de la marque Anthropic en France grâce à des relations stratégiques avec les partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous élaborerez et déploierez des stratégies de mise sur le marché (GTM) propres à chaque marché, adaptées aux pratiques commerciales et aux nuances culturelles locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous composerez avec les enjeux locaux de réglementation, de conformité et de souveraineté des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous créerez un avantage concurrentiel grâce aux capacités singulières des partenaires et à des propositions de valeur élaborées en commun.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste pourrait vous convenir si vous réunissez les atouts suivants :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit d’initiative et le goût de construire : vous êtes à l’aise pour partir de zéro et créer des partenariats d’envergure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez l’anglais et le français.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous comptez au moins 8 ans d’expérience dans les partenariats technologiques à destination des entreprises, idéalement dans le cloud, l’IA/ML ou les activités de plateforme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une culture de la donnée, tournée vers les résultats mesurables et l’atteinte des KPI, et un historique avéré de revenus additionnels générés grâce aux partenariats dans la région.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez démontré votre capacité à assurer la réussite des clients et la protection de la marque via les canaux partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit de compétition : la victoire et la différenciation sont votre moteur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une approche collaborative et savez travailler de façon transversale avec les équipes commerciales, produit, marketing et régionales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous nourrissez une vraie passion pour l’IA et vous vous reconnaissez dans la mission d’Anthropic : développer une IA bénéfique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relations de travail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre rattachement hiérarchique se fera auprès de la direction des partenariats internationaux, tandis que votre activité quotidienne sera pilotée par la personne responsable des partenariats EMEA Sud. Vous travaillerez également en étroite collaboration avec la direction commerciale régionale d’Anthropic et ses Account Executives, ainsi qu’avec les équipes Customer Success et Applied AI de la région.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu et déplacements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste est basé à Paris, en France, avec des déplacements à prévoir pour rencontrer les partenaires et les clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical leadership role responsible for building and scaling Anthropic&#39;s consulting, GSIs and AI-native boutique partners in France.&lt;br&gt;You will be working closely with the sales team to make sure customers are adopting AI through our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a builder role, not a manager role.&lt;/strong&gt; Given Anthropic&#39;s stage, we need someone who has proven they can take partnerships from zero to scaled revenue engines — someone who has built these relationships from the ground up, not just inherited and managed existing ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships and execution:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage closely with the sales team to understand how partners can support customer Claude adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will guide partners in creating repeatable customer solutions that address specific use cases across industries including financial services, healthcare, retail, manufacturing, public sector, and professional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance and KPI ownership:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive key performance indicators, partner-influenced revenue, partner delivery, consultants trained and certified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every deal influenced through your partner portfolio must be architected for customer success and long-term value expansion. You will establish success criteria for joint accounts, ensure proper implementation and adoption support, and create feedback loops that drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on partnership health, progress, and commercial outcomes with data-driven insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Development &amp;amp; Brand Building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amplify the Anthropic brand in France strategic partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute market-specific GTM strategies adapted to local business practices and cultural nuances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate local regulatory, compliance, and data sovereignty considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create competitive differentiation through unique partner capabilities and joint value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mentality — comfortable starting from zero and creating scaled partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluent in English and French&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in enterprise technology partnerships, ideally within cloud, AI/ML, or platform businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with focus on measurable outcomes and KPI attainment. Track record of driving incremental revenues through partnerships in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of delivering exceptional customer success and brand protection through partner channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive drive — obsessed with winning and creating differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative approach with ability to work cross-functionally across sales, product, marketing, and regional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for AI and alignment with Anthropic&#39;s mission of beneficial AI development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will formally report to the International Partnerships leader, while your day-to-day work will be led by our South EMEA Partnerships lead. You will also partner closely with Anthropic&#39;s regional sales leader and their Account Executives, as well as the in-region Customer Success and Applied AI teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in Paris, France with travel expected to engage with partners and customers externally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€260.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Sales  Paris

Senior Engineer I, Total Product Support &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job’s mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer, Total Product Support&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will take ownership of highly visible technical projects and drive them from planning through execution and delivery. Acting as the central point connecting engineering teams, operations, and customers, you will ensure that technical solutions are developed, tested, implemented, and supported successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a strong engineering foundation who enjoys bringing people together, solving problems, and turning technical requirements into clear actions. You do not need to be the subject matter expert in every technical area, but you should be comfortable working with engineers, understanding complex technical concepts, asking the right questions, and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate technical projects from initial planning through execution, customer delivery, and program close-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop execution plans, define priorities, coordinate resources, and ensure key project milestones and deliverables are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination between engineering teams, technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the build and qualification phase of technical solutions, including coordinating in-house testing, additional test equipment, technical evaluations, and readiness for customer implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers to understand technical challenges, determine where additional expertise or consultation is required, and drive issues toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate directly with customers to understand requirements, provide transparent project updates, and support successful technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress, identify risks and roadblocks early, and communicate openly when plans, deliverables, or timelines are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze project and test outcomes, coordinate follow-up activities, and ensure programs are properly completed and transitioned into customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer operational activities across multiple stakeholders while maintaining accountability for overall project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and concise reporting on high-visibility projects to stakeholders and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Physics, Materials Science&lt;/strong&gt;, or another relevant technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid engineering foundation and the ability to understand and communicate technical concepts across different engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project coordination skills with the ability to plan, organize, and drive activities from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, including the confidence to work with engineers, managers, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with a proactive and hands-on approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify risks, communicate challenges transparently, and escalate issues when necessary rather than waiting for problems to resolve themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technologies, processes, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, adaptability, and a strong “can-do” mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in semiconductor equipment, high-tech manufacturing, mechanical/electrical systems, or another complex engineering environment (not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating multidisciplinary teams and translating between technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant professional, internship, research, or project experience demonstrating the ability to coordinate technical work and drive execution is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and the confidence to challenge assumptions, raise concerns, and create alignment across different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to project execution combined with the flexibility to adapt when technical priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking accountability for highly visible projects where clear and timely communication is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally, typically &lt;strong&gt;1–2 times per year&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on project and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> SU3.Metal Dep- VF KPU

Field Marketing Manager - France &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Field Marketing Manager for France, you’ll own Verkada’s regional presence and play a key role in expanding our footprint across EMEA. Verkada is a high-growth technology company with a proven product, a vast addressable market, and the resources to win it - and you’ll be instrumental in driving that next chapter of growth! You’ll work closely with a fun, collaborative marketing and sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Serve as the “CMO” for your territory-owning regional marketing strategy while executing a diversified program mix that includes Verkada-hosted events, regional trade shows, webinars, and other demand-generating initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Become the ‘go-to’ person for marketing in the French region, and act as the advocate/evangelist for our marketing strategy. Partner and develop a trusted peer relationship with the Regional Sales Directors, EMEA Marketing Leadership and cross-functional leaders on the overall strategy and expected marketing results. Build face-to-face relationships with these stakeholders on a regular basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate ability to build relationships with European customers and thought-leadership bodies, and use this input to enhance marketing outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Refine field marketing strategies &amp;amp; processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop and plan the regional field marketing plan to meet customer, growth, and revenue objectives for your region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute best-in-class region and local language campaigns, both direct and with partners. This includes trade shows, lunch &amp;amp; learns, technical hands-on workshops, roundtables, webinars, top account marketing, and other tactics as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Sales leadership to tactically engage key target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Devise and execute marketing experiments to meet the unique requirements of your region and scale and automate successful campaigns that have shown strong ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Closely track budgets, lead flow and follow-up, and results against goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communicate status, action items, results, and deliverables across marketing and sales.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1765165153.879259&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1765165153.879259&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__background p-message_pane_message__message c-message_kit__message&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_container&quot; data-qa-unprocessed=&quot;false&quot; data-qa-placeholder=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;5+ years of events marketing and demand generation experience in B2B, preferably with a fast-growing tech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience working across France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven track record executing innovative and multi-part event and demand generation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience using data and metrics to drive improvements, including a high level of expertise using Microsoft Excel to manipulate and analyse data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to travel as needed to events &amp;amp; conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree, preferably in business, finance, technology, or sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Successful Candidates Will Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A strong work ethic, team-player mentality, and experience working in a fast-paced, dynamic work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A self-starter approach, willing to have full ownership of your region and projects from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Understanding of how to work with Value Added Resellers and Distributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to partner with and provide consultative input to senior sales leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to engage customers and partners in dialogue about their business needs and security solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verkada Is An Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Verkada is committed to providing employment opportunities to all individuals. All applicants for positions at Verkada will be treated without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, age, marital status, veteran status, pregnancy, or any other basis prohibited by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.verkada.com/privacy/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/E_spClO3Ac9pX43h9dXa8/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1719327847319000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw10eB41dX5dzNP9yveIJLsf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Field Marketing & Events  Paris

Infrastructure Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Garda Capital Partners (Garda) is a multi-billion dollar alternative investment firm with over 22 years of experience deploying relative value strategies across fixed income markets for institutional investors. We hire, grow, and mentor great talent and remain steadfast in our commitment to building a culture that helps them succeed. Garda is more than a workplace. We are built on trust, integrity, and a shared vision for how we work together, the enduring relationships we build, and the consistency of our results. Garda&#39;s primary offices are located in Wayzata, New York City, West Palm Beach, Geneva, Zug, Copenhagen, Singapore, and Scottsdale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Garda is seeking an Infrastructure Engineer to own Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Automation. This hands-on role builds and operates shared deployment capabilities for infrastructure and selected applications, while providing advanced infrastructure engineering and production support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The engineer develops reusable deployment pipelines, infrastructure templates, and self-service workflows that help teams provision environments and release changes consistently — working with architecture, application owners, and regional teams to improve platform reliability and resolve complex infrastructure problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Escalation &amp;amp; Infrastructure Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior escalation point for complex infrastructure incidents and recurring operational problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot across Windows/Linux systems, identity, networking, cloud, virtualization, storage, and backup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis and convert recurring incidents into engineering work or documented standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in major changes, recovery events, and follow-the-sun handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Deployment Automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automation using PowerShell, Python, and APIs with production-quality testing and error handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own reusable infrastructure-as-code and configuration templates (Terraform, Ansible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate CI/CD pipelines for infrastructure and applications, including validation, environment promotion, health checks, and rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Git, peer review, automated tests, change controls, and secure secrets handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Observability, Reliability &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve monitoring, logging, metrics, dashboards, alerting, and automated health checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tune operational signals to reduce noise and improve detection/recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain reusable provisioning workflows and self-service capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own platform reliability and lifecycle improvements with service owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and workplace technology staff in troubleshooting and automation practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review infrastructure code and pipeline designs with architecture, Security, and application owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain runbooks, diagrams, and onboarding guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a prioritized platform backlog with the architect and regional leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Desired Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–6 years of hands-on infrastructure operations experience across several domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in IT, computer science, computer engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced PowerShell or Python automation experience, including API integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with infrastructure as code or configuration management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and supporting CI/CD pipelines (Git, testing, secure deployment, rollback)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, root-cause analysis, and incident-response skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of monitoring, logging, alerting, and observability concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to document work, mentor others, and collaborate across a distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preference for experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS, container platforms, modern cloud operating patterns (Azure a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering reusable provisioning workflows for infrastructure and business applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ITSM, change, incident, and problem-management practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial services or another performance-sensitive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of solving complex infrastructure problems and building shared capabilities other teams can use independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of maintaining high standards for reliability, documentation, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience remaining effective under pressure, with a history of mentoring and knowledge-sharing within teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
